  "body": "Step into modern comfort and coastal living with this brand-new, two-level home in the sought-after Torbay neighbourhood. Offering three bedrooms, two bathrooms and well-designed living spaces, this is an exciting opportunity for first-home buyers, young families or investors looking for a quality property in a desirable North Shore location.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor welcomes you with a contemporary kitchen, dining and living area, designed for effortless everyday living and entertaining. Through glass sliding doors, the dining area flows onto a private deck, creating a lovely spot for outdoor dining, weekend relaxation or hosting friends. A guest toilet and single garage add everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three well-proportioned bedrooms are complemented by two bathrooms, providing comfort and convenience for the whole household. The master bedroom enjoys direct access to a balcony, while an additional access point from the upstairs corridor offers another way to step outside and enjoy the fresh coastal air.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the sought-after school zoning for Long Bay College, Torbay School and Northcross Intermediate, making this an appealing choice for those prioritising education.\r\n\r\nThe location further enhances the lifestyle on offer. Spend your weekends exploring the walking tracks and open green spaces of Long Bay Regional Park, or head to nearby Waiake Beach for a refreshing seaside escape. With the best of Torbay's coastal surroundings close at hand, a relaxed outdoor lifestyle comes naturally.\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, securing a modern family home or adding to your investment portfolio, this brand-new home presents an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nModern design, practical living and a coastal lifestyle — make this home yours.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
